<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Datums</span> <span lang="EN-GB">Description</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Datums functionality allows the user to scan in bodyline co-ordinates. Creating datum features and co-ordinate systems from these features is possible after data capture is completed. Transformations created from various features can be applied to the data sets at any stage.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Datums include the following geometric primitives  point, line, plane, sphere, cylinder, circle, cone, rectangular slot, and round slot:</span></p>
<p><b>Datum Point</b>  it is defined by its co-ordinates. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP170701661" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/image002p.jpg" width="406px" height="235px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Line</b>  it is defined by the co-ordinates of its first and last points. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP165336427" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/image004l.jpg" width="358px" height="186px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Plane</b>  it is defined by co-ordinates of a point laying on the plane, and a normal. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP230778421" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/datums_description2.jpg" width="406px" height="235px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Sphere</b>  it is defined by co-ordinates of its centre and radius. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a4" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP231132266" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/datums_description1.jpg" width="297px" height="227px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Cylinder</b>  it is defined by the normal of its axis and radius. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a5" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP168734165" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/image010cyl.jpg" width="406px" height="235px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Circle</b>  it is defined by co-ordinates of its centre, radius, and the normal of the plane where it lays. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a6" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP232516166" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/image012.jpg" width="406px" height="235px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Cone</b>  it is defined by co-ordinates of its apex, radius, and the normal of the axis. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a7" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP229945554" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/Image013.jpg" width="406px" height="235px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Rectangular Slot</b>  it is defined by co-ordinates of its centre, the normal of the plane where it lays, the axis on the plane, length, and width. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a8" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP228766252" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/Image017.jpg" width="406px" height="235px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p><b>Datum Round Slot</b>  it is defined by co-ordinates of its centre, the normal of the plane where it lays, the axis on the plane, length, and radius. <a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a9" style="text-decoration:underline;">Preview</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP231059611" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../images/Image018.jpg" width="406px" height="235px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p>New Datums can be created using the <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../../User_Interface/datuming_menu.htm">Datuming Menu</a> or</span> <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../../User_Interface/Tree_Context_Menus.htm#Specific_Commands_for_Datuming">Tree Context Menus</a>.</span></p>

